// The card-to-wasm backend: a tutucard `.html` in, a `tutuca:component@0.9.0`
// core wasm module out.
//
// One of TWO backends over `tscript`'s one AST: the MoonBit emitter
// (`tscript/emit_mbt`) turns a block into source ahead of time, and this one
// compiles it. Both are held to the same corpus (`tscript/conformance`),
// because a language with two implementations and no shared table has two
// semantics.
//
// There was a third — an interpreter that ran a card where it stood, and what
// `tutucard` mounted. It is gone, and this is what replaced it: a card is
// mounted by compiling it and instantiating the module. That is a bigger claim
// than it sounds, because the interpreter was the REFERENCE — every "which is
// what the interpreter does" in this package was a pointer at a running answer.
// What makes it safe to have removed is that the corpus states those answers
// outright now, and that closing the gap turned up nine places where this
// backend was quietly answering something plausible where the language answers
// nothing at all.
//
// It compiles in a BROWSER, which is the whole reason it exists: the card
// playground hands you a real bundle with no server and no toolchain.
//
// Three packages, split where the seams are THIN and not where they are merely
// nameable. `internal/abi` is the canonical ABI's numbers, the constant pool
// and the three Wax types everything here speaks in — fifty-odd uses, each
// reading better qualified (`@abi.ret_get_field`). `internal/waxsrc` is the Wax
// source every module carries — two uses. The instruction builders stayed here,
// in `dsl.mbt`: three hundred uses, and qualifying them would undo the one
// thing that file exists to do, which is to let the emitters read as the Wax
// they stand for rather than as a tree walk.
import {
  "marianoguerra/wax/ast",
  "marianoguerra/wax/ast/build",
  "marianoguerra/wax/basic",
  "marianoguerra/wax" @waxfacade,
  "marianoguerra/wax/syntax/trivia",
  "marianoguerra/wax/compile",
  "marianoguerra/wax/message",
  "marianoguerra/tutuca/tutucard/wasm/internal/abi",
  "marianoguerra/tutuca/tutucard/wasm/internal/waxsrc",
  "marianoguerra/tutuca/core" @tutuca,
  "marianoguerra/tutuca/viewfile",
  "marianoguerra/tutuca/statedef",
  "marianoguerra/tutuca/statedef/info",
  "marianoguerra/tutuca/tscript",
  "marianoguerra/tutuca/tscript/check",
  "moonbitlang/core/json",
  "moonbitlang/core/ref",
}
